{:frontmatter
 {:id "adr-2607031400-itonami-games-atproto-actors-app-aozora"
  :title "ADR-2607031400: itonami games as AT-Protocol actors — per-game Worker-held identity, posting to app-aozora"
  :status "accepted"
  :date "2026-07-03"
  :deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"]
  :doc_type "adr"
  :topic "itonami-games-atproto-actors-app-aozora"
  :authoritative true
  :authoritative_for
  ["each cloud-itonami itonami game (public/games/itonami/<slug>/) gets its
    own Ed25519 did:key CACAO actor identity, not one shared account"
   "keys are Worker-custodial (Level A per ADR-2607032300), NOT minted
    out-of-band per game -- addendum revises the original per-game
    cacao/mint + N Worker secrets design to instead reuse app-aozora's own
    aozora.pds.actorkey HKDF derivation (operator master + game-did ->
    per-game Ed25519 key), one master secret not N"
   "backend/ Worker gains POST /api/itonami/publish: derives the requesting
    game's key via that HKDF scheme, signs a com.atproto.repo.createRecord
    commit into THAT GAME'S OWN per-actor graph (canonical-graph(game-did,
    db) per ADR-2607032300), never a shared/operator graph"
   "new lexicon network.isekai.session (extends the declared-but-unemitted
    network.isekai.asset precedent, ADR-0008 §5) for in-game events: round
    cleared, fork, urgent-bonus catch"
   "publish is Governor-gated the same containment shape as
    com-etzhayyim-tashikame/kouhou (ADR-2607022200/2607022210): game client
    proposes, a lightweight rule (not an LLM) approves/denies, every
    publish/deny appended to an audit trail"
   "rollout: wire one game (plumbing-rounds) end-to-end first, then extend
    the same wiring to the remaining games mechanically"
   "migration path to self-sovereign (Level B, actor's own key-backup signs
    client-side) is the same one ADR-2607032300 defines for aozora's own
    actors -- blocked on the same not-yet-built .cljc CACAO client-signing
    port, not a separate itonami-specific blocker"]
